        "notes": "This VR game features intense, first-person combat in a dark, poorly-lit, and eerie environment. Players wield melee weapons and firearms to fight enemies. Combat is accompanied by graphic blood effects and realistic corpses scattered throughout the environment. The game also contains frequent use of strong language. The overall atmosphere, combined with the gore and unsettling settings, may disturb sensitive players."
